{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Combine any two cards to trigger AI-generated stories and items.&quot;<br><br>\u258c Core Experience: AI Real-time Narrative Engine</strong><br>Every card combination triggers the AI to generate unique items and storylines. Unbound by pre-programmed code, anything in your imagination can become a tool for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u258c First Scenario: Desert Island Survival</strong><br>Put your common sense to the test! Survive hunger, wild beasts, diseases, and unexpected threats born from the AI's whims on this unforgiving island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u258c Roadmap: More Scenarios &amp; Advanced AI Architecture</strong><br>Infinite possibilities through AI generation! Future updates will bring diverse scenarios like band management and modern warfare, powered by continuously evolving AI systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u258c The Grand Vision: Scenario Editor</strong><br>Why limit creation to developers? Our built-in Scenario Editor will empower every player to craft their own haunting narratives.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866740?t=1752204565","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866740/4071170e622fabe5ba0cd8880abcf1ecb5c676bf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752204565","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866740/7e1d4947a7e543bb3a62babfa0761f280826e83a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752204565","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866740/7e1d4947a7e543bb3a62babfa0761f280826e83a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752204565","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mou